  "notes": "{会話|かいわ} means 'conversation' and functions as a suru-verb.\n\nCommon collocations:\n- {会話|かいわ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to converse, to have a conversation\n- ⟦{日常|にちじょう}→日常：01595_nichijou⟧{会話|かいわ}: daily conversation\n- ⟦{英会話|えいかいわ}→英会話：14810_eikaiwa⟧: English conversation (learning)\n- {会話|かいわ}⟦{力|りょく}→力：01661_chikara⟧: conversational ability\n\n{会話|かいわ} vs. ⟦{話|はなし}→話：01496_hanashi⟧:\n- {会話|かいわ}: two-way conversation\n- ⟦{話|はなし}→話：01496_hanashi⟧: can be one-way (story, talk) or two-way",
